**What stands out:**
- **The top three are well ahead of the rest.** After them, revenue drops to $954K for Spider-Man 2.
- **Insomniac, Santa Monica and Polyphony each have more than one game in the top 10.** Polyphony has three Gran Turismo games: GT7, Gran Turismo Sport and Gran Turismo 5.
- **The Gran Turismo games earn less per purchase.** GT7 has the most transactions (54K) but about $17 of revenue each. God of War (2018) earns about $57 per transaction.
- **Helldivers 2 keeps the least of its revenue.** Its net developer revenue ($660K) is about 6% below its gross ($700K). For most other games in the top 10, net is nearly the same as gross.

**What this covers:**
- **Revenue:** this is digital game revenue (base game, DLC, microtransactions and similar purchases) since the data begins. Hardware and subscription revenue aren't tied to individual games, so they're left out.
- **Matching sales to games:** each sale is linked to its game through the product sold. This counts about 10% of revenue that has no game recorded on the sale itself and would otherwise be missed.

